RulesPolicy%28%29%20%7B%0A%20%20const%20source%20%3D%20readFileSync%28sourceFile%2C%20%27utf8%27%29%3B%0A%20%20return%20%7B%20schemaVersion%3A%201%2C%20model%3A%20%27bounded%20recursive%20default%20CST%20attachment%201%27%2C%20source%2C%20sourceSha256%3A%20digest%28source%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20defaults%3A%20%7B%20depthLimit%3A%20readEmbeddedRegionDefaultLimit%28%27depth%27%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20countLimit%3A%20readEmbeddedRegionDefaultLimit%28%27count%27%29%2C%20byteLimit%3A%20readEmbeddedRegionDefaultLimit%28%27bytes%27%29%20%7D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20primitiveBasis%3A%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20coordinates%3A%20%27Every%20planner%20bound%20is%20an%20absolute%20UTF-8%20byte%20offset%20in%20the%20original%20host%20source.%20Child%20bounds%20stay%20inside%20their%20immediate%20host.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20ancestry%3A%20%27A%20dense%20parent%20column%20names%20strictly%20earlier%20frames%3B%20canonical%20language%20identifiers%20and%20both%20byte%20bounds%20must%20agree%20for%20an%20ancestry%20match.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20reuse%3A%20%27The%20current%20whole%20host%20is%20not%20parsed%20again%2C%20except%20the%20original%20first-level%20alias%20view%20when%20the%20requested%20root%20spelling%20differs.%20Nested%20already-attached%20views%20add%20no%20duplicate%20self-boundary.%20A%20more%20distant%20identical%20invocation%20reports%20a%20non-consuming%20cycle.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20order%3A%20%27Hosts%20are%20processed%20in%20FIFO%20order%3B%20each%20original%20direct%20region%20is%20inserted%20before%20descendants%20and%20every%20descendant%20names%20its%20containing%20Region.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20charges%3A%20%27Every%20admitted%20child%20parse%20attempt%20charges%20one%20region%20and%20its%20complete%20physical%20byte%20length.%20The%20root%20parse%20is%20excluded%3B%20overlapping%20child%20bytes%20are%20charged%20again%20for%20each%20parse.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20diagnostics%3A%20%27A%20refused%20region%20retains%20its%20boundary%20and%20an%20error%20Relation%20with%20the%20reason%2C%20current%20counters%20and%20applicable%20observed%20value%20and%20limit.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20budgets%3A%20%27Adapter%20depth%2C%20attempted%20region%20count%20and%20total%20child%20parse%20bytes%20are%20separate%20from%20the%20registered%20parsers%20own%20evaluation%2C%20recovery%2C%20memory%20and%20nesting%20budgets.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20rendering%3A%20%27Overlapping%20source-token%20views%20of%20the%20same%20physical%20bytes%20render%20once%3B%20unspanned%20constructed%20fragments%20retain%20their%20original%20order.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20boundary%3A%20%27Default%20registered%20parser%20attachment%20only.%20This%20policy%20does%20not%20establish%20generic%20any%2Fall%20grammar%20selection%20or%20proved%20global%20concept%20identity.%27%2C%0A%20%20%7D%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Constant%20DATA%20keeps%20the%20later%20native%20const%20configuration%20constructor%20intact.%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20renderEmbeddedRegionNativeDefaults%28defaults%29%20%7B%0A%20%20const%20fields%20%3D%20%5B%5B%27DEPTH%27%2C%20%27depthLimit%27%5D%2C%20%5B%27COUNT%27%2C%20%27countLimit%27%5D%2C%20%5B%27BYTE%27%2C%20%27byteLimit%27%5D%5D%3B%0A%20%20for%20%28const%20%5B%2C%20field%5D%20of%20fields%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20if%20%28%21acceptEmbeddedRegionLimit%28defaults%5Bfield%5D%29%29%20throw%20new%20TypeError%28%27native%20adapter%20defaults%20require%20nonnegative%20safe%20integers%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20return%20%27%2F%2F%20Generated%20DATA%20from%20the%20shared%20embedded-region-rules.js%20defaults.%20Do%20not%20edit.%5Cn%27%0A%20%20%20%20%2B%20fields.map%28%28%5Bname%2C%20field%5D%29%20%3D%3E%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20const%20literal%20%3D%20String%28defaults%5Bfield%5D%29.replace%28%2F%5E%5B0-9%5D%7B5%2C%7D%24%2Fu%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20digits%20%3D%3E%20digits.replace%28%2F%5CB%28%3F%3D%28%3F%3A%5B0-9%5D%7B3%7D%29%2B%24%29%2Fgu%2C%20%27_%27%29%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20%60pub%20const%20DEFAULT_EMBEDDED_REGION_%24%7Bname%7D_LIMIT%3A%20usize%20%3D%20%24%7Bliteral%7D%3B%60%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%29.join%28%27%5Cn%27%29%20%2B%20%27%5Cn%27%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Aexport%20async%20function%20generateEmbeddedRegionRules%28%7B%20check%20%3D%20false%2C%20native%20%3D%20false%20%7D%20%3D%20%7B%7D%29%20%7B%0A%20%20const%20policy%20%3D%20embeddedRegionRulesPolicy%28%29%3B%0A%20%20for%20%28const%20file%20of%20policyFiles%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20if%20%28check%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20%28%21isDeepStrictEqual%28readProjectData%28file%29%2C%20policy%29%29%20throw%20new%20Error%28%27embedded%20region%20source%20policy%20is%20stale%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%20else%20writeProjectData%28file%2C%20policy%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20const%20defaults%20%3D%20renderEmbeddedRegionNativeDefaults%28policy.defaults%29%3B%0A%20%20if%20%28check%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20if%20%28readFileSync%28defaultsFile%2C%20%27utf8%27%29%20%21%3D%3D%20defaults%29%20throw%20new%20Error%28%27native%20embedded%20region%20default%20DATA%20is%20stale%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%20else%20writeFileSync%28defaultsFile%2C%20defaults%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20fixture%20%3D%20recursiveEmbeddedRegionCases%28%29%3B%0A%20%20if%20%28check%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20if%20%28%21isDeepStrictEqual%28readProjectData%28fixtureFile%29%2C%20fixture%29%29%20throw%20new%20Error%28%27authored%20recursive%20default%20region%20fixtures%20are%20stale%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%20else%20writeProjectData%28fixtureFile%2C%20fixture%29%3B%0A%20%20if%20%28native%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20%7B%20parseJavaScript%20%7D%20%3D%20await%20import%28%27..%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Fjavascript.js%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20%7B%20checkProgram%20%7D%20%3D%20await%20import%28%27..%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Fcheck.js%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20%7B%20emitRust%20%7D%20%3D%20await%20import%28%27..%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Femit-rust.js%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20emitted%20%3D%20emitRust%28checkProgram%28parseJavaScript%28policy.source%2C%20%7B%20referenceSemantics%3A%20false%20%