ing%20from%20holdout%20evaluation%20and%20test%20adversarial%20rejections%20and%20real%20projects%20under%20several%20independent%20oracles.%20Record%20precision%2C%20recall%2C%20F1%2C%20CST%20fields%2C%20trivia%2C%20spans%2C%20attributed%20behavior%2C%20reconstruction%2C%20grammar%20size%2C%20determinism%2C%20query%20counts%2C%20elapsed%20time%20and%20peak%20memory.%27%2C%20%5B%27trainingAndHoldoutSeparated%27%2C%20%27multipleIndependentOraclesAndProjectsUsed%27%2C%20%27allRequiredQualityAndResourceMetricsRecorded%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-COMPARATIVE-BENCHMARKS%27%2C%20%27reproducible%20inference%20comparison%20within%20common%20budgets%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Benchmark%20existing%20inference%20and%20selected%20modern%20methods%20with%20the%20same%20pinned%20workloads%20and%20budgets.%20Retain%20all%20failures%20and%20disagreement%20traces%2C%20select%20reproducible%20improvements%20without%20weakening%20acceptance%2C%20and%20keep%20statistical%20coverage%20distinct%20from%20semantic%20proof.%27%2C%20%5B%27commonBudgetsAndWorkloadsUsed%27%2C%20%27failuresAndDisagreementsRetained%27%2C%20%27reproducibleImprovementMeasured%27%2C%20%27statisticsNotPresentedAsProof%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-CI-RESOURCE-POLICY%27%2C%20%27bounded%20JavaScript-first%20inference%20development%20and%20CI%20artifacts%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Use%20targeted%20JavaScript%20authoring%20locally%3B%20run%20Rust%20compilation%2C%20broad%20discovery%20experiments%2C%20whole%20corpora%20and%20downstream%20workloads%20in%20CI%20with%20bounded%20caches%20and%20per-run%20artifacts.%20Record%20critical%20scope%2C%20API%20parity%20and%20exact%20executed%20observations%20without%20completion%20claims%20for%20missing%20behavior.%27%2C%20%5B%27javascriptFirstInferenceDevelopment%27%2C%20%27expensiveInferenceAndRustRunInCI%27%2C%20%27boundedCachesAndRunArtifacts%27%2C%20%27exactEvidenceAndApiParityRecorded%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%2