ure%20grammars%20through%20the%20existing%20automatic%20native%20pipeline.%27%2C%20%5B%27lexicalRecursiveAndSemanticDiscoveryExecuted%27%2C%20%27allSourceProductionsAndProvenanceRetained%27%2C%20%27discoveredAndOfficialGrammarsMerged%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-FORMAL-CONCEPT-INTEGRATION%27%2C%20%27discovered%20concepts%20integrated%20with%20recursive%20formal%20definitions%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Copy%20discovered%20concepts%20into%20the%20single%20global%20space%20with%20formal%20definitions%20that%20recursively%20reference%20other%20linked%20concepts.%20Deduplicate%20only%20checked%20context-preserving%20one-to-one%20meaning%20certificates%3B%20equal%20strings%2C%20names%2C%20glosses%20or%20finite%20samples%20do%20not%20establish%20equivalence%2C%20and%20unresolved%20alternatives%20survive.%27%2C%20%5B%27discoveredConceptsAndFormalDefinitionsLinked%27%2C%20%27contextPreservingMeaningCertificatesChecked%27%2C%20%27unresolvedDiscoveryAlternativesPreserved%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-DETERMINISTIC-REFINEMENT%27%2C%20%27deterministic%20counterexample-guided%20incremental%20discovery%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Seeded%20discovery%20is%20deterministic%20and%20supports%20counterexample-guided%20refinement%2C%20incremental%20updates%20and%20checkpoint%20resume%20without%20losing%20the%20examples%2C%20decisions%2C%20assumptions%20or%20rejected%20alternatives%20used%20to%20obtain%20the%20grammar.%27%2C%20%5B%27seededDiscoveryDeterministic%27%2C%20%27counterexampleAndIncrementalRefinementExecuted%27%2C%20%27checkpointResumeRetainsEvidence%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-SOURCE-FREE-SNAPSHOTS%27%2C%20%27source-free%20discovered%20grammar%20snapshots%20in%20text%20and%20versioned%20binary%20links%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Discovered%20snapshots%20restore%20and%20extend%20through%20link-cli%2C%20text%20Links%20Notation%20and%20a%20versioned%20binary%20links%20representation%20without%20their%